 wheel served locally, not forwarded upstream:\u001b[K\u001b[7;44H  1. handle_terminal_part gets the SgrMouseEvent and dispatches to LocalHistoryView.wheel.\u001b[K\u001b[8;44H  2. wheel() resolves the pane via _route_at; a hit on an agent viewport scrolls _HistoryViewport.offset and returns HistoryAction with render_history=True and forward\u001b[9;44Hed_input=b\"\" — no upstream input.\u001b[K\u001b[10;44H  3. apply_h"]
[3.060165, "o", "istory_action only sends upstream when action.forwarded_input is set; empty means nothing reaches tmux. The overlay is painted client-side via surface.pain\u001b[11;44Ht_overlays.\u001b[K\u001b[12;44H  4. This is a fast-client history overlay over bounded snapshots, not tmux copy-mode; the implementation notes stock tmux WheelUpPane would enter copy-mode, which is \u001b[13;44Hdeliberately avoided.\u001b[K\u001b[14;44H  Focused test: tests/test_fast_full_window.py::test_local_history_routes_sidebar_immediately_and_owns_agent_wheel asserts agent_action.forwarded_input == b\"\".\u001b[K\u001b[15;44H  Suggested addition: assert agent_action.render_history is True, proving the overlay rendered rather than merely dropping the event.\u001b[K\u001b[16;44H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[38;5;147m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;239m──────────────────\u001b[39;44H───────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[40;44H───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[38;5;244m  ⏵⏵ normal mode · s\u001b[41;44Hhift+tab to cycle · ← for agents\u001b[38;5;239m───────────\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[30m\u001b[48;5;70m\r\n Railmux · Claude Code · ▣                                                                                                                                                               \u001b[38;5;231m→ new session in railmux\u001b[30m \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[41;76H"]
